  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_06",
  "title": "邂逅",
  "storyCode": "RI-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "aa58f1c291f119841904e00ac9a4857887ec42bcc4d1f689595d12bdfab924e8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungleentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼只有你們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巨木部族的人不見了，我聽說好像他們的首領被一個外來者打敗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火石部族還有粗尾部族被一個不知道哪裡來的背著很多武器的傢伙給全打趴下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有幾個部族選擇了加入祖瑪瑪的部族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老實說，祖瑪瑪搞出來的陣仗真厲害，要不是我是嘉維爾的追隨者，說不定也要去加入祖瑪瑪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有你們幾個部族的人也足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，我們真的能戰勝祖瑪瑪嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾一定能夠戰勝祖瑪瑪的巨大機器，到時候，就由我來成為大酋長，讓嘉維爾留下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "佩塔覺得，這樣不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，這是唯一能讓嘉維爾留下來的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要忘了，我們是為了什麼才成立的“嘉維爾意志”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“嘉維爾意志”不只是一個部族，是我們所有希望嘉維爾成為大酋長的人的聯盟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我支持特米米，我只認嘉維爾做大酋長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，嘉維爾才是應該領導我們的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，要是我不同意，我就不會站在這裡了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......佩塔不喜歡，但是佩塔會做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼你們到了祖瑪瑪部族外面等我來找你們，明白了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "其他族長",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，一切都是為了嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "其他族長",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一切都是為了嘉維爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，還有其他人也在！太好了，終於找到你們了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，博士，你可把我擔心壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？煌，你怎麼就把泳裝穿——你的背上怎麼還有個人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這小姑娘是我剛才走在路上遇到的，也不知道怎麼回事見面就打我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我肯定打回去啊，就把她和她手下全給打趴下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不得不說這小姑娘身手還不錯，也挺抗打，我就帶上了，想著找到你之後讓你幫我問問為什麼要打我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，克瑪爾的話，我覺得她大概就是單純看你挺厲害，就想跟你打一架，這傢伙可是個戰鬥狂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，能被你這麼評價的傢伙還真是稀奇啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我又不是戰鬥狂，我只是習慣用比較直接的方法解決問題而已啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行行行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這裡是......哪裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你醒了，克瑪爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾？！你怎麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你遇到了我的同伴，對她出手然後被她打倒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，你終於醒了，小姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，嘉維爾，她幹什麼，怎麼剛醒就忽然向我彎腰了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克瑪爾，你要幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在她身上感受到了連我在祖瑪瑪身上都沒感受過的更純粹的強大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，我對你失去興趣了。你好像能和她交流，幫我告訴她，請指導我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，她說讓你教她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啥？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概意思就是覺得你太強了，想做你小弟，這樣的感覺吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士，怎麼辦啊，我從沒遇到過這種事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這要由你來決定。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不關我事。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，要不讓她先跟著我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也行，喂，克瑪爾，你先跟著我們好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，現在，叫我燧石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，祭典怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你來給煌講解一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不惜讓手下感染礦石病也要造機器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，這我可不能坐視不管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那還等什麼，博士，繼續前進吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，我們還有另一個地方要去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
